From eb8778077e5003e6abb59af6c7efb4bd5daa35b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 14:58:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arch/mips: Add support for Airoha EN7528 and TP-Link
 XC220-G3V

Add support for the Airoha EN7528 SoC and the TP-Link XC220-G3V board.
This includes platform-specific clock and reset controller integration
via SCU regmap helpers, updated driver dependencies, and the board
configuration for chainloaded execution.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
